   "description": "Pre-order item — non-refundable. This is a pre-order with a longer production lead time. Please place your order only if you are comfortable with the estimated delivery timeline and the terms below. Pre-order Summary VibroShield ×1 — Absorb Armor Black Shield with Sapphire Fusion Crystal Limited to 100 pieces Estimated delivery: February 2027 Production and delivery timelines are estimates and may change due to manufacturing or logistics. We will keep customers informed of any significant changes. Movement Skeleton Automatic A.FAH-104-2026-XS × Dandong Peacock VibroShield Protection System VibroShield features our mechanical impact-isolation system, designed to reduce the transmission of external shock before it reaches the watch case, crystal, and movement. Case & Crystal Protection Frame: 316L Stainless Steel Crystal case: Sapphire Fusion Crystal Water Resistance: 3 ATM / 30 m Warranty 12-month limited international warranty , starting from the date of delivery. Pre-order Terms This is a made-to-order pre-order . Because production is arranged specifically for this run, all pre-orders are non-refundable once the order has been placed . By placing an order, you acknowledge and accept the estimated production and delivery timeline.",
